---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="PTE Preparation in Kathmandu | Computer-Based English Test | Link Wave"
  description="Prepare for PTE Academic with AI-driven scoring. Fast results in 48 hours. Expert coaching at Link Wave Global Study, Putalisadak, Kathmandu."
>
  <section class="tp-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-text reveal">
          <span class="badge">Test Preparation</span>
          <h1>PTE Preparation</h1>
          <p>The Pearson Test of English (PTE) is a computer-based English proficiency test with AI-driven scoring. Get results within 48 hours. Accepted worldwide for study, work, and immigration.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="contact-us" class="btn btn-gold">Enroll Now</a>
            <a href="tel:+9779851410481" class="btn btn-outline-white">Call Us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-icon reveal">
          <svg width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1"><path d="M12 14l9-5-9-5-9 5 9 5z"/><path d="M12 14l6.16-3.422a12.083 12.083 0 01.665 6.479A11.952 11.952 0 0012 20.055a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.824-2.998 12.078 12.078 0 01.665-6.479L12 14z"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">What is PTE?</h2>
      <div class="content-card reveal">
        <p>The Pearson Test of English (PTE) is a computer-based English proficiency test designed to assess the language skills of non-native English speakers. Recognized by universities, colleges, and governments worldwide, PTE is widely used for study abroad, work, and immigration purposes.</p>
        <p>Unlike other English tests, PTE is known for its <strong>AI-driven scoring system</strong>, which ensures fair and unbiased results. It provides fast results, typically within 48 hours, making it a preferred choice for students and professionals on tight deadlines.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Components - same grid as IELTS -->
  <section class="section bg-light">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">What is PTE Composed Of?</h2>
      <div class="components-grid reveal">
        <div class="component-card">
          <div class="comp-icon"><svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M3 18v-6a9 9 0 0118 0v6"/><path d="M21 19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1a2 2 0 01-2-2v-3a2 2 0 012-2h3zM3 19a2 2 0 002 2h1a2 2 0 002-2v-3a2 2 0 00-2-2H3z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Listening</h3>
          <p>Summarizing spoken text, filling in blanks, multiple-choice questions, and highlighting incorrect words.</p>
          <span class="duration">45-57 minutes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="component-card">
          <div class="comp-icon"><svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 01-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Speaking</h3>
          <p>Read aloud, repeat sentence, describe image, and retell lecture tasks.</p>
          <span class="duration">30-35 minutes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="component-card">
          <div class="comp-icon"><svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M4 19.5A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 17H20"/><path d="M6.5 2H20v20H6.5A2.5 2.5 0 014 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 016.5 2z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Reading</h3>
          <p>Multiple-choice questions, reorder paragraphs, and fill in the blanks.</p>
          <span class="duration">29-30 minutes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="component-card">
          <div class="comp-icon"><svg width="36" height="36" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 013 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg></div>
          <h3>Writing</h3>
          <p>Summarize written text and essay writing tasks.</p>
          <span class="duration">30-40 minutes</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PTE Score Chart -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">PTE Academic Score Guide</h2>
      <div class="score-cards reveal">
        <div class="score-card highlight">
          <span class="score-range">85-90</span>
          <span class="cefr">C2</span>
          <p>Highest level. Can understand virtually everything heard or read and express spontaneously and fluently.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="score-card">
          <span class="score-range">76-84</span>
          <span class="cefr">C1</span>
          <p>Required for Australian Skilled Migration Visas. Can use language flexibly for academic and professional purposes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="score-card">
          <span class="score-range">59-75</span>
          <span class="cefr">B2</span>
          <p>Required for academic level instruction. Can interact with fluency and produce clear detailed text.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="score-card">
          <span class="score-range">43-58</span>
          <span class="cefr">B1</span>
          <p>Required for undergraduate study. Can deal with familiar situations and produce simple connected text.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="score-card">
          <span class="score-range">30-42</span>
          <span class="cefr">A2</span>
          <p>Foundation level. Can communicate in simple routine tasks and describe immediate environment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  /* Include all the same styles from IELTS page */
  .tp-hero { background: var(--secondary); color: var(--primary-white); padding: 5rem 0; }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 3rem; align-items: center; }
  .badge { display: inline-block; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); padding: 0.35rem 1rem; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .hero-text h1 { color: var(--primary-white); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .hero-text p { opacity: 0.9; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 600px; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero-icon { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
  .btn-gold { background: #ffd700; color: var(--secondary); padding: 0.85rem 2rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: all var(--transition); }
  .btn-gold:hover { background: #ffe44d; transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255,215,0,0.3); }
  .btn-outline-white { border: 2px solid var(--primary-white); color: var(--primary-white); padding: 0.85rem 2rem; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; transition: all var(--transition); }
  .btn-outline-white:hover { background: var(--primary-white); color: var(--secondary); }
  .section { padding: 5rem 0; }
  .bg-light { background: var(--gray-100); }
  .section-title { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .content-card { background: var(--primary-white); padding: 2.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--gray-200); max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; }
  .content-card p { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .components-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .component-card { background: var(--primary-white); padding: 2rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--gray-200); text-align: center; transition: all var(--transition); }
  .comp-icon { color: var(--tertiary); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .component-card h3 { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .component-card p { color: #666; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .duration { display: inline-block; background: rgba(101,45,144,0.08); color: var(--tertiary); padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; }
  
  .score-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .score-card { background: var(--primary-white); padding: 1.75rem; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--gray-200); text-align: center; }
  .score-card.highlight { border-color: var(--tertiary); background: rgba(101,45,144,0.03); }
  .score-range { display: block; font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--secondary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .cefr { display: inline-block; background: var(--tertiary); color: white; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .score-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; line-height: 1.6; }

  .cta-dark { background: var(--secondary); color: var(--primary-white); padding: 4rem 0; text-align: center; }
  .cta-dark h2 { color: var(--primary-white); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .cta-dark p { opacity: 0.9; margin-bottom: 2rem; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-icon { display: none; }
  }
</style>